      "name": "Vic Viper Beginning",
      "effect": "This turn, this card's name becomes \"Gradius\". Then, you can send up to 2 other monsters from your hand or field to the Graveyard. If you sent a monster to the Graveyard, you can Special Summon \"Gradius' Option\" from your Graveyard to your field in face-up Defense Position equal to [the number of monsters sent to the Graveyard by this effect]."
